  "solution": {
    "text": "The desired number is the coefficient of <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow></msup></math> in <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />= coefficient of <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow></msup></math> in <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />= coefficient of <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></math> in <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />= coefficient of <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></math> in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>8</mn></msup><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />= coefficient of <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></math> in <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />= coefficient of <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></math> in <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo></math> coefficient of <math><mi>x</mi></math> in <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></mrow><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><mn>9</mn></menclose><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><mn>8</mn></menclose></mrow><mrow><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><mn>4</mn></menclose><mo>&#215;</mo><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><mn>3</mn></menclose><mo>&#215;</mo><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><mn>2</mn></menclose></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>330</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>64</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>26</mn><mn>6</mn></math>"
